<title>UK: Bacob unit sets 400 million Danish crown bond.</title>
<headline>Bacob unit sets 400 million Danish crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ASLK-CGER and Bacob Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BACOB OVERSEAS LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BACOB BANK</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    15.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.0     PAY DATE  L-15.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  DENOMS (K) 10-100    YIELD	 5.60 PCT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
